{
  "function": "canonicalPayload",
  "source": "src/main/updates/manifest.ts",
  "note": "decode: none\narg0 is the version, arg1 the file entry { url, sha512, size }, as verifyManifest passes them after its checks; scripts/release-sign.mjs signs the same string as UTF-8 bytes.\nCases outside verifyManifest's checks (a newline in a field, a non-integer size) show the template literal's own formatting: a number prints as JS String(n) does, a missing field as 'undefined'.",
